Changes made from the original:
- Ported the six reviewer agents and the review orchestrator from Claude Code
  plugin format (agents/*.md + commands/*.md with Claude Code frontmatter) to
  GitHub Copilot CLI custom agent format (.agent.md files).
- Replaced the origin codebase's project-specific conventions (Sentry, Statsig,
  constants/errorIds.ts, specific JS/React style rules) with generic guidance
  that defers to each repository's AGENTS.md / .github/copilot-instructions.md /
  CLAUDE.md / configured linters.
- Reworked the /review-pr command into a review-pr orchestrator agent that
  delegates to the reviewers via Copilot CLI's subagent (agent) tool.
- Added opencode ports of the agents (plugins/pr-review-toolkit/agents-opencode/)
  with opencode permission blocks enforcing their advisory, read-only role.
